{"resourceIdentifier":"4137","resourceName":"Productive Second Floor with Macaúba","description":"The “Productive Second Floor with Macaúba” is a VCS AFOLU (Agriculture, Forestry and Other Land Use) grouped project, Scope 14, and, specifically, it falls under the ARR (Afforestation, Reforestation and Revegetation) category. \r\nThe project works with local farmers to implement integrated systems in previously degraded pastures and/or croplands. The main project activity consists of the planting of Macaúba trees. This will be done considering two possible arrangements: (i) Macaúba intercropped with pasture (silvipastoral) or (ii) macuaba intercropped with agriculture (agrisilvicultural).\r\nThrough the planting of Macaúba trees the project will contribute to an increase in carbon stocks and associated GHG removals. The project activity will also improve the livelihood of local farmers and provide other ecosystem services, such as: maintaining the local microclimate, preventing erosion, conserving soil and moisture.","location":{"latitude":-18.196895,"longitude":-46.360955},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-12-01","endExclusive":"2024-01-01","endInclusive":"2023-12-31"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4137"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Minas Gerais, São Paulo and Pará States"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"INOCAS"},{"type":"string","value":"38700140, Brazil"},{"type":"string","value":"contato@inocas.com.br"},{"type":"string","value":"www.inocas.com.br"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5212"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_